          "Material supply and warehouse request creation, triggered automatically upon production order release.",
          "Operation confirmation via CO11N, with statuses updated to CNF (Confirmed) or PCNF (Partially Confirmed).",
          "Final operation confirmation and goods receipt posting, updating inventory and associating materials with sales order references (status DLV)."
